@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K41_352_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	IF TFLAG:193
	;あなたしゃべり過ぎだろこれ
		PRINTFORMW 「...Heeeh?」
		PRINTFORMDW Nue didn't seem to understand what you just said to her.
		PRINTFORMW 「...Sorry, can you repeat that please?」
		PRINTFORMDW You grab Nue by the shoulders, look her straight in the eyes and say it once again, loud and clear.
		PRINTL
		PRINTFORMDW ――I love you Nue. I want you to be my girlfriend.
		PRINTL
		;added, when she was refused too many times and you confess yourself
		IF CFLAG:1002 == 3
			PRINTFORMDW As you repeat your confession again, Nue gets all sulky.
			PRINTFORMW 「Eh... Eh? B-But... What's with the sudden change of heart?」
			PRINTFORMW 「You said it yourself last time when I confessed, not once, but twice! That we can't be together...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Are you... are you playing with my feelings, %MASTERNAME:41%? Is this a joke? Do you find it funny?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Please, don't do this to me...」
			PRINTFORMDW Nue says as she starts sobbing quietly.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――I love you Nue. I made a mistake, and I'm sorry. I want to make you happy and share my path with you.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW You say as you take her hands and look her directly in the eyes.
			PRINTFORMDW ...But Nue seems unconvinced as she brushes your hands away.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「Really...? You think you can just get away with a half-assed apology like that, and make it all better?」
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"Do you even... do you even *know*... how much effort and courage it took me... to confront my feelings, and finally confess them to you...?", "w"
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"I went through that... multiple times! And you turned me down, again and again! At some point it hurt too much to be refused again, so I stopped...", "w"
			PRINTFORMDW Nue fixes you with a freezing gaze, her voice sounds raspy from forcing herself to speak...
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「And let's not forget that time where we pretended that everything was fine. I think that hurt even more.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Every time it would remind me of things that could be, but that would never come true.」
			PRINTFORMW 「If I knew better... If only I wasn't so stupid as to let my feelings take over, I'd...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'D RATHER PREFER THAT WE HAD NEVER MET!!!」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW Nue lets out a loud scream, letting out all of the frustrations that no doubt were tormenting her for a while.
			PRINTFORMDW It's quite heartbreaking to see her like this, but after all... you were the cause.
			PRINTFORMDW Steadying your resolve, you approach her closer while she steps back.
			PRINTFORMW 「Please, just get away from me, %MASTERNAME:41%... I just want to forget all this...」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――It's not too late yet, Nue.
			PRINTFORMDW ――I've come around.
			PRINTFORMDW ――I knew you were always the one for me.
			PRINTFORMDW ――I love you, Nue.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW You approach Nue close as she tries to back away from you until she has nowhere to go.
			PRINTFORMDW She seems distressed and desperate, but you're determined.
			PRINTFORMDW You hug her against her will as she starts beating and clawing at your back...
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「Why... Why are you so stubborn... Why can't you just give up?!」
			PRINTFORMW 「You don't get it, do you? A girl's heart is a fickle thing... It was good back then, but now it's too late!」
			PRINTFORMW 「I already made peace with that, so why won't you?!」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――But the fact that you wanted us to stay friends says otherwise, Nue.
			PRINTFORMDW ――You still had hope, and I was too blind to see it.
			PRINTFORMDW ――If we decide to break up now, the regret will tear us both apart...
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW Feeling a bit weak from the wounds, you collapse on one knee.
			PRINTFORMDW Seeing that, Nue panics and helps you up.
			PRINTFORMW 「Ah, %MASTERNAME:41%...! Are you okay? Hang on, I'll help you bandage it...!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Sorry, I went a bit too hard there. Haha, you humans are sure fragile...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Yet my mind, the mind of a youkai, is just as easily broken.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Siiiigh... Everything I just said sounds like a lie, doesn't it? I still care so much about you...」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW After a few minutes, you feel a lot better. Turns out the wounds weren't that serious.
			PRINTFORMDW It's just that the weight of the situation and the anxiety got the best of you it seems.
			PRINTL
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"...But, I get what you're saying, %MASTERNAME:41%. And I see that you're not just putting on a show, especially after all this...", "w"
			PRINTFORMW 「I suppose... we can give each other another chance. But once we get together, it's forever.」
			PRINTFORMW 「You won't be able to back out again, you hear? Well, I'm sure you already knew what you were signing up for.」
			PRINTFORMW 「We suit each other pretty well after all, as hopeless lovesick idiots that we are... Haha.」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW Nue sighs and then smiles wryly, though clearly being in a better mood than before.
			PRINTFORMDW She hugs you gently and brings your faces together...
			PRINTFORMW 「It's way better when it's love that tears us apart, and not regret.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Even though your confession sucked, I accept it. We will be together, whether we like it or not.」
			PRINTFORMW 「...I love you, %MASTERNAME:41%.」
			PRINTFORMDW ...And then joins your lips in a rough, but passionate kiss.
			
			;added
			;this event will take your first kisses, I don't care (at this point it'd be weird if you both were kissless at all anyway)
			CALL SPECIAL_FIRSTKISS(@"%PRINT_DATE_F(DAY)%, Nue gave her first kiss to %CALLNAME:MASTER% after getting back together during the confession")
		ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕
			PRINTFORMDW As you repeat your confession again, Nue's face immediately flushes.
			PRINTFORMW 「...Y-You dummy! What are you even saying...?!」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'm a youkai, and you're a human! You do understand what that means, right...?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I have eaten many humans in my life, and I will continue to do so.」
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"And it's not just about me either. To youkai, humans are just like cows and chickens. They don't have any value beyond being food.", "w"
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"I care about you the same way as I would when speaking with cattle to pass the time. There's no friendship or love there.", "w"
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW As the conversation goes on, Nue's expression becomes darker and darker...
			PRINTFORMDW Then, she turns her back to you before continuing.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「No matter how much you confess your love to me, you'll remain nothing more than a prey to me.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Even at this very moment, if I'm hungry, I might just decide to gobble up some of your flesh on the spot.」
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"The idea of a youkai and a human falling in love is just a myth... A pipedream, a fantasy that you wished were true...", "w"
			PRINTFORMW 「So please, do me a favor... and never say this silly stuff again, that you love me and all that...」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW After going out of her way to lay all of it into you, Nue falls silent.
			PRINTFORMDW With the way her shoulders were trembling a little, she didn't look much like the "youkai" she had talked about earlier.
			PRINTFORMDW ...It was just a girl who was too stubborn to admit her true feelings.
			PRINTL 
			PRINTFORMDW The next thing you knew, you were hugging Nue from behind.
			PRINTFORMW 「...What are you trying to achieve here? Did you listen to a word I said?」
			PRINTFORMDW Nue retorts with harsh, stinging words.
			PRINTFORMDW You whisper in her ear, slowly, word by word, as if to convince her...
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――You don't have to make up lies anymore.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ...Nue goes wide eyed for a moment.
			PRINTFORMW 「...Lies?　When have I ever lied to you?」
			PRINTFORMDW However, she quickly hardens her expression and puts on her usual smug guise of looking down at people.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――Nue was lying to herself all the time.
			PRINTFORMDW ――She didn't want to admit to herself that she liked humans.
			PRINTFORMDW ――She didn't want to believe that she could enjoy spending time with the humans she'd always thought of as mere prey.
			PRINTFORMDW ――Thus, she suppressed her feelings and chose solitude for herself.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「...Stop it.」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――But the truth is, she always really wanted to be with someone.
			PRINTFORMDW ――Yet she was too afraid of letting people know her true feelings.
			PRINTFORMDW ――Instead choosing to keep a distance from everyone and anyone.
			PRINTL 
			PRINTFORMW 「...Not... another word...」
			PRINTL 
			PRINTFORMDW ――Everything Nue did was a lie all along.
			PRINTL
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「I SAID STOP ITTTTTTT――!!!」
			PRINTL
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW You get slammed against the wall.
			PRINTFORMDW It wasn't until a few seconds later that you realized that Nue had hit you and blown you away.
			PRINTFORMDW In front of you, Nue stands with tears in the corners of her eyes.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「...Yes, you're right. I'm a huge liar.」
			PRINTFORMW 「"The same as speaking with cattle to pass the time?" Haha, what a stupid thing to say.」
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"You were the one always coming first to talk with me, even though I was always sulking somewhere in the corner at the temple.", "w"
			IF GROUPMATCH(CFLAG:1001,1,3)
				PRINTFORMW 「At first I thought you were boring, I really did. But you always listened to what I had to say.」
			ELSE
				CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"I thought you might've had off-beat perceptions compared to regular humans, but you were surprisingly a normal %PRINT_MALE("guy", MASTER)% I could talk to.", "w"
			ENDIF
			PRINTFORMW 「And you always tolerated all my jokes and pranks with a smile.」
			PRINTFORMW 「There's no way someone like that is the same as cattle...!」
			PRINTFORMDW Nue, overcome with emotion, grabs you by the collar and sobs repeatedly...
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「What the heck is your deal, %MASTERNAME:41%... Really, I can never make sense of it...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Just being around you makes me feel at ease...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Just listening to the sound of your voice makes me feel content...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Just touching you a little fills me with so much warmth...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Why, why are you making me feel this way...?!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Tell me! Tell me what is this unidentified emotion that is nesting inside me!!!」
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW She probably doesn't even know what she's talking about. Nue is ranting in a rambling, incoherent manner.
			PRINTFORMDW Seeing that, you reach out and gently pat her on the head before speaking out again.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――Isn't that what "love" is all about?
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ...Nue's expression became stiff.
			PRINTFORMW 「Are you telling me... is this what it feels like to love...?」
			PRINTFORMDW She then takes her time to reflect on your words.
			PRINTFORMW 「Love... Does that mean... I'm in love with you, %MASTERNAME:41%...?」
			PRINTFORMDW Tears flow from Nue's eyes.
			PRINTFORMDW It's as though the yearning she froze inside herself and kept deep within is starting to melt away――
			PRINTFORMW 「Love... I'm in love. That's right, I love you, %MASTERNAME:41%...!」
			PRINTFORMDW Overcome with emotion, Nue bursts into tears as she nuzzles her face in your chest.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ...It wasn't until a few minutes later that Nue calmed down and pulled away.
			PRINTFORMW 「...I'm sorry I messed up your clothes.」
			PRINTFORMDW Nue's face turns red and she looks down in shame, as if remembering what she had just said.
			PRINTFORMDW You decide that it would be too cruel to ask Nue to give an answer in her current state, and try to walk away.
			PRINTFORMW 「Hey, w-wait...!」
			PRINTFORMDW But as you prepare to leave, she hugs you from behind.
			PRINTFORMW 「I haven't responded... to your confession yet, have I...」
			PRINTFORMW 「When I heard you say that you love me, it made me really really happy.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I know I've said some horrible things, and gotten a little rough, but...」
			PRINTFORMW 「If you still love me despite all that, then... I... I wanna be your girlfriend, %MASTERNAME:41%...!」
			PRINTFORMDW That must've been the most anxious that you've ever heard Nue sound so far.
			PRINTFORMDW Her body leaning against your back was trembling erratically, like a small animal.
			;the original speaks about nue turning her waist, but it doesn't make sense??
			PRINTFORMDW You take her arm as you turn around and face her.
			PRINTFORMDW Then, you hug Nue as hard as you can.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMW 「...Are you sure? Even if I'm like this, you don't mind...?」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'm not as pretty as Hijiri, and I'm not as honest as Shou...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I'm not as charming as Murasa, nor as capable as Ichirin, nor as witty as Nazrin...」
			PRINTFORMW 「And yet, you still choose me...?」
			PRINTFORMDW Nue asks faintly as you lean in to whisper in her ear, quietly yet ever so reassuringly.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――I'll say it again, I love Nue. Nue is a good girl. Nue is the best.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW As you tell her that frankly, Nue finally smiles.
			;boyfriend/girlfriend is probably a bit too casual, and lover with beloved sounds silly
			PRINTFORMW 「Thank you, %MASTERNAME:41%... My beloved "sweetheart"...!」
			PRINTFORMDW Nue murmurs back as she gently joins her lips with yours...
			
			;added
			;this event will take your first kisses, I don't care (at this point it'd be weird if you both were kissless at all anyway)
			CALL SPECIAL_FIRSTKISS(@"%PRINT_DATE_F(DAY)%, Nue gave her first kiss to %CALLNAME:MASTER% after the unforgettable heartfelt confession she received")
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMDW As you repeat your confession again, Nue frowns in dismay.
			PRINTFORMW 「Uuhhh... No hard feelings %MASTERNAME:41%, but here's some friendly advice... You might wanna reconsider this.」
			CALL PRINT_DIALOGUE, @"You are human, and I'm a youkai. It's not like you don't know what that means, right? I'm telling you this for your own good...", "w"
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW ――Still, I want to go out with you, Nue.
			PRINTL
			PRINTFORMDW She blushes as you say that looking straight into her eyes, even if just a little.
			PRINTFORMW 「...Good grief, you're a hard %PRINT_MALE("man", MASTER)% to please, %MASTERNAME:41%.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Yeah, I get it. Fine then. I find you to be a good friend too, so...」
			PRINTFORMW 「I don't mind playing the part when it comes to being your girlfriend, if that's what you want.」
			PRINTFORMW 「...Well, that's it, then. Treat me well from now on, "lover"...」
		ENDIF
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「What's wrong? You look like fish out of water.」
	ENDIF
